/ele to hunt enemy riders near F1/"},{"seq":1050,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c328","house":"orchid","letter":"L404","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK JKQTD LBJG WMRT."},{"seq":1051,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c329","house":"orchid","letter":"L405","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"DKQRM, IBQOD TK JKQTD LBJG WMRT."},{"seq":1052,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c330","house":"orchid","letter":"L406","kind":"order","to":"orchid-ele-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6000,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"MHMNDBJTR, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG WMRT."},{"seq":1053,"t":5700,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1897,"retries":0},{"seq":1054,"t":5700,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is Watch 20/30. Orchid has sent multiple aggressive orders targeting my positions (SBE). I must react to the captured Orchid letters, especially the attack order at SBE. My doctrine suggests acting on enemy mail. I will reinforce SBE and use my cavalry to screen/attack the app"},{"seq":1055,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c331","house":"tiger","letter":"L407","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":5700,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1056,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c332","house":"tiger","letter":"L408","kind":"order","to":"tiger-cav-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":6000,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"BKNOP, SQQSRF SQ OKUQB TSJF WPOQ."},{"seq":1057,"t":5700,"type":"courier","id":"c333","house":"tiger","letter":"L409","kind":"letter","to":"orchid-camp","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","orchid-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"WE WILL MEET YOUR AGGRESSION WITH STRENGTH.","cipher":"WP WCGG HPPQ YKUN SA